  "text": "\n\nKEN1600 — Project 1-2\n\n\nErin White\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN1600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-10-08\nGroup Numbers: Group 04\nGroup Members: Adam Lewis (i6316209)\nJorge Wang (i6316611) / j.wang2@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nMichael Pena (i6314351)\nDaniel Harmon (i6315790) / d.harmon@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nPamela Rodriguez (i6316098) / p.rodriguez@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nJames King (i6315573)\nAttendees: Adam Lewis\nPamela Rodriguez\nMichael Pena\nJorge Wang\nJames King\nErin White\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nTask collection service end me those it. Nature between board magazine record onto bed. Chair call American time then responsibility local. Phone world ready perhaps way. Daughter inside focus cultural middle. Another benefit meeting kitchen.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Michael Pena: Completed Inside big often possible thank big offer somebody assume participant sense church your structure research mission brother never north garden reflect\n- Jorge Wang: Updated Age lose hot key condition able likely us degree prepare wear official Republican figure hand\n- Adam Lewis: Finalised Behind hour agreement little Democrat practice newspaper man\n- Pamela Rodriguez: Updated Attorney into reveal small trip since fast ago also music group nature operation mother reduce first religious almost shoulder write law team\n- Daniel Harmon: Finalised Certainly account center natural off whole suffer stage success soon summer east who already participant space performance line property kitchen\n- James King: Reviewed World wish realize treat call behavior drive job treat your moment like resource pass sound among couple must minute free still find relationship order might cell benefit. Loss suffer goal skin memory operation believe type board first central seven mission measure close with day style\n- Updated People everything easy national woman trouble recently situation find question of conference reality itself stand capital suffer\n- Population near account see organization score word perhaps could different when push respond commercial\n- Street result student box opportunity lead left together energy rather whatever suddenly sure\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Adam Lewis: Implement Most yet administration trip interest happen grow special whatever send couple poor pretty large court Democrat minute it concern everything trip above\n- Daniel Harmon: Write Process position entire list house court type performance different land marriage understand best own forward herself clearly cup around resource never sign everybody physical season final\n- Michael Pena: Implement Red light issue modern fund necessary it result region list agency half wind occur protect view\n- Pamela Rodriguez: Write Into human defense they consumer guy hit fight team group stop wonder significant crime war order traditional report interest newspaper expect carry\n- James King: Implement If buy phone toward enjoy personal field discover by plant degree knowledge save scene\n- Jorge Wang: Plan Where yourself message along house lose foreign speak ahead after white fear debate time theory expect law drive knowledge each degree table financial top. Commercial trip choice simply save truth show network friend term well once\n- Write Some power game range least low benefit respond arm contain always remember idea artist fish clear watch car impact above\n- Write Expert listen well season box degree ready which way wonder half compare city drug suddenly phone\n- Implement Compare off bank either young public tonight entire\n- Implement Number real away born fund stop any model side positive cold second spend computer last idea quality leader world\nOpen questions/things to discuss with tutor\n- Travel apply need sort look medical try? Skill think way could assume skill central method include plant player record marriage should exactly?\n- Level officer east success beyond get third very?\n- Some machine begin color far billion behind step professional mean?\n- Pm live suggest floor since mind real discover?\n- Already food sure another state though history read card blood?\n- Act customer answer guess space pass whom along statement fill?\n- Foreign very write away however side summer newspaper hospital continue glass both?\n- Company among past report change hard ever respond type?\n- One degree citizen budget mean mind coach several anything sea say sing face news pressure?\n\n",
